#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.metainfo.xml.in:17
msgid "Open images with Resizer or open Resizer and Drag and drop images"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.metainfo.xml.in:18
msgid "Maintains aspect ratio."
msgstr "Conservation du ratio."

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid ""
"Keyboard control: Change the sizes using the up and down keys, press enter "
"to resize."
msgstr ""
"Contrôles au clavier : Modifiez les dimensions en utilisant les flèches haut "
"et bas, appuyez sur entrée pour redimensionner."

#: data/io.github.peteruithoven.resizer.metainfo.xml.in:20
msgid "Settings are stored for next time."
msgstr "Les paramètres sont mémorisés pour la prochaine fois."

